		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ττω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>substitute,</i> esp. in Rhet.,
				<i>substitute one case for another,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				59
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				232.2
			</span></i>; of <i>interchange</i> of moods, in 
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				211.19
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>receive in exchange,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θνητὸν ἀθανάτου βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.440
				</span></i>
			.</div>
